# The run ledger of the receipt of Mathesis (verification/receipts/theory_praxis.deed),
# read by scripts/grade-receipt.sh through the shared generator of standards
# (scripts/proof-receipt.sh). One row a run and prover:
#   prover|run|commit|checker|invocation|inputs sha256|what the run reported|state|reason|axioms[|imports|trusted base]
# Append-only: a new run is a new row (grade-receipt.sh --record), and a row the
# default branch holds is never changed or dropped.
# The rows before run 43498592499 predate the inputs digest (PROOF-POLICY 8.5.1):
# their digest is computed from git at the row's commit with the pinned
# proof-inputs-sha256.sh, over the input set the same rules give for that run
# (Agda: the cone of THY-1's root; Rocq and Lean: each file the run compiled,
# and lean-toolchain). Those runs checked THY-1 only (grade-receipt.sh,
# receipt_run_scope). Their invocations are the ones the receipt recorded; the
# runs from 43498592499 on checked every claim through the gate, whose
# invocation each row names.
